{"seq":2,"slug":"crossborder-pool-fx-regulatory","title":"跨境归集的外汇/资本项目监管约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/cash-pool-structure/crossborder-pool-fx-regulatory","wordCount":2509,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨境归集的外汇-资本项目监管约束\">跨境归集的外汇/资本项目监管约束</h1><p>境内归集是银行产品问题，跨境归集是<strong>监管准入问题</strong>。一个集团能把境内子公司的钱归到一起，不代表能把钱划到境外，更不代表能自由地在成员之间调剂。跨境资金流动在中国受经常项目与资本项目的分类管理约束，而资金池恰恰是把两类资金混在一起操作的载体，因此它必须走专门的备案通道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>资金池的跨境约束来自一层分类：经常项目（贸易、服务等）项下的收付相对便利，资本项目（外债、境外放款、直接投资等）项下的跨境流动受额度与登记管理。资金池要做的事——集中收付、余缺调剂、轧差净额——横跨两类，所以监管的解法是：<strong>给一个统一的载体，同时给它两类额度，并要求逐笔可还原申报</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[境内主办企业] --&gt; B[国内资金主账户]&#10;    B --&gt; C[经常项目集中收付]&#10;    B --&gt; D[轧差净额结算]&#10;    B --&gt; E[外债额度集中]&#10;    B --&gt; F[境外放款额度集中]&#10;    E --&gt; G[任一时点风险加权余额 ≤ 集中额度]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    C --&gt; H[涉外收付款申报 + 还原数据申报]&#10;    D --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; I[一次性外债/境外放款登记]\">graph TD\n    A[境内主办企业] --&gt; B[国内资金主账户]\n    B --&gt; C[经常项目集中收付]\n    B --&gt; D[轧差净额结算]\n    B --&gt; E[外债额度集中]\n    B --&gt; F[境外放款额度集中]\n    E --&gt; G[任一时点风险加权余额 ≤ 集中额度]\n    F --&gt; G\n    C --&gt; H[涉外收付款申报 + 还原数据申报]\n    D --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; I[一次性外债/境外放款登记]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>业务类型</th>\n<th>监管属性</th>\n<th>关键约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>经常项目集中收付</td>\n<td>经常项目</td>\n<td>凭登记表办理的业务不得参加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轧差净额结算</td>\n<td>经常项目</td>\n<td>每个自然月至少轧差一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外债额度集中</td>\n<td>资本项目</td>\n<td>风险加权余额 ≤ 备案额度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>境外放款额度集中</td>\n<td>资本项目</td>\n<td>风险加权余额 ≤ 备案额度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>境外成员集中收付</td>\n<td>占用外债额度</td>\n<td>需专门操作细则</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"现行备案通道-两套并行的规则\">现行备案通道：两套并行的规则</h2><p>当前境内跨国公司资金池有两条并行的规则线，集团需按自身规模与需求择一，且<strong>原则上不得同时办理其他跨境资金池业务</strong>。</p>\n<p>第一条是 2025 年底发布、在全国范围内推广的<strong>本外币一体化资金池</strong>。据国家外汇管理局政策法规栏目公布的文件，其规模门槛为：境内全部成员企业上年度本外币国际收支规模合计不低于等值 70 亿元人民币，境内全部成员企业上年度营业收入合计不低于 100 亿元人民币，境外全部成员企业上年度营业收入合计不低于等值 20 亿元人民币；境内外成员企业合计不得少于三家（见 <a href=\"https://www.safe.gov.cn/safe/2025/1226/26960.html\">关于跨国公司本外币一体化资金池业务有关事宜的通知</a>）。这一档门槛面向大型跨国集团。</p>\n<p>第二条是 2026 年 8 月发布、自 2026 年 9 月 14 日起施行的<strong>本外币跨境资金集中运营</strong>规则，同时废止了此前的汇发〔2019〕7 号。它的门槛显著低一档：一般地区要求境内成员上年度本外币国际收支合计不低于等值 7 亿元人民币，或境内成员收入合计不低于 10 亿元人民币且境外成员收入合计不低于等值 2 亿元人民币；自由贸易试验区则减半为等值 3.5 亿元人民币，或境内成员收入 5 亿元人民币且境外成员收入等值 1 亿元人民币（见 <a href=\"https://www.safe.gov.cn/safe/2026/0814/27781.html\">关于跨国公司本外币跨境资金集中运营业务有关事宜的通知</a>）。两档门槛给了中型集团一条现实路径。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;poolType&quot;: &quot;cross_border_cash_management&quot;,&#10;  &quot;regulatoryBasis&quot;: &quot;银发〔2026〕163号&quot;,&#10;  &quot;applicant&quot;: { &quot;role&quot;: &quot;主办企业&quot;, &quot;mustBe&quot;: &quot;境内独立法人成员企业&quot; },&#10;  &quot;eligibility&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;excludedIndustries&quot;: [&quot;金融机构&quot;, &quot;地方政府融资平台公司&quot;, &quot;房地产企业&quot;],&#10;    &quot;minGroupMembers&quot;: 3,&#10;    &quot;tradeClassification&quot;: &quot;A类&quot;,&#10;    &quot;noMajorViolationYears&quot;: 2&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;filing&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;authority&quot;: &quot;主办企业所在地国家外汇局分局&quot;,&#10;    &quot;accountOpeningDeadline&quot;: &quot;备案通知书出具后一年内&quot;,&#10;    &quot;changeFilingDays&quot;: 30&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"poolType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cross_border_cash_management\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"regulatoryBasis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"银发〔2026〕163号\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"applicant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"主办企业\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mustBe\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"境内独立法人成员企业\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"eligibility\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"excludedIndustries\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"金融机构\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"地方政府融资平台公司\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"房地产企业\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"minGroupMembers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tradeClassification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A类\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"noMajorViolationYears\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"filing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"authority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"主办企业所在地国家外汇局分局\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"accountOpeningDeadline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"备案通知书出具后一年内\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"changeFilingDays\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"两类额度的计算与占用\">两类额度的计算与占用</h2><p>跨境资金池最核心的量化约束是<strong>额度</strong>。额度不是一个固定数字，而是由成员权益与一组宏观审慎参数算出来的上限，且被两类业务分别占用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"外债额度集中的计算公式\">外债额度集中的计算公式</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>外债集中额度</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>主办</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{外债集中额度} = \\left( E_{\\text{主办}} + \\sum_i E_i \\cdot \\rho_i \\right) \\times L \\times \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">外债集中额度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">主办</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 为经审计的上年度所有者权益，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为境内成员企业自行决定的集中比例（每年度最多调整一次），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为跨境融资杠杆率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 为宏观审慎调节参数。据上述 2026 年规则，初始参数为 <strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.75</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu = 1.75</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.75</span></span></span></span></span>、汇率风险折算因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span></strong>；风险加权余额按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mtext>本外币外债余额</mtext><mo>+</mo><mo>∑</mo><mtext>外币外债余额</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\text{本外币外债余额} + \\sum \\text{外币外债余额} \\times 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">本外币外债余额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">外币外债余额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 计算。资金池<strong>在任一时点</strong>的风险加权余额不得超过集中额度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"境外放款额度的参数差异\">境外放款额度的参数差异</h3><p>境外放款采用对称但参数不同的公式，额度 = 所有者权益基数 × 境外放款杠杆率 × 境外放款宏观审慎调节系数。两套规则的这一组参数存在差异：一体化资金池规则下的初始参数为境外放款杠杆率 <strong>1</strong>、宏观审慎调节系数 <strong>0.8</strong>、币种转换因子 <strong>0.5</strong>；而 2026 年跨境资金集中运营规则下对应系数为 <strong>0.6</strong>（见前述两份通知）。这一差异直接影响同一集团在两条通道下可放款的规模，是选型时必须逐条比对的地方。</p>\n<h3 id=\"集中比例与未集中部分的处理\">集中比例与未集中部分的处理</h3><p>境内成员可以选择只集中一部分权益，未集中的部分仍可按一般规定通过自身外债账户或境外放款专户办理。这让额度管理具备了颗粒度：集团可以把权益留给最需要跨境融资的成员，而不是强制全量进入资金池。</p>\n<h2 id=\"账户结构-轧差净额与申报还原\">账户结构、轧差净额与申报还原</h2><h3 id=\"国内资金主账户与-nra-账户\">国内资金主账户与 NRA 账户</h3><p>主办企业在合作银行开立<strong>国内资金主账户</strong>，作为整个资金池的操作中枢。该账户可以是含人民币的多币种账户，开户数量不受限制但须符合审慎监管要求，且<strong>允许日间及隔夜透支</strong>——透支资金只能用于对外支付，收到资金后应优先偿还透支款。集团还可选择一家境外成员企业开立 NRA（境外机构境内外汇/人民币）账户，用于集中管理境外成员资金。</p>\n<h3 id=\"轧差净额结算的监管形式\">轧差净额结算的监管形式</h3><p>资金池把境内外成员经常项目下的应收应付款集中核算，把一定时期内的多笔收付合并为一笔交易。监管对频率有下限要求：<strong>原则上每个自然月轧差净额结算不少于一次</strong>。这条频率约束把净额结算从&quot;技术优化&quot;变成了一项持续义务——它迫使集团建立定期归集与对账的运营节奏，否则账户间的应收应付会持续挂账。</p>\n<p>按规定须凭《货物贸易外汇业务登记表》办理的业务<strong>不得参加</strong>集中收付和轧差净额结算。这条排除项是理解资金池边界的钥匙：资金池不是万能的资金通道，它排除的正是那些本身就需要逐笔审批的高监管密度交易。</p>\n<h3 id=\"申报与还原\">申报与还原</h3><p>每笔集中收付都要办理涉外收付款统计申报并报送账户信息；更重要的是，<strong>境内划转还需办理实际收付数据和还原数据申报</strong>。还原申报意味着：资金池内部的划转虽然物理上是一笔笔转账，但在统计上必须还原成&quot;谁实际付给谁、对应哪笔贸易&quot;的原始面貌。这是监管允许资金池存在的前提条件——池子可以合并操作，但不可合并真相。合作银行须及时、完整、准确地向 RCPMIS 报送基础信息、跨境收支、账户及余额等数据，银行与主办企业各自留存证明交易真实合法的文件单证<strong>五年备查</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;  pm.entity_code,&#10;  pm.currency,&#10;  SUM(pm.gross_receivable) AS gross_receivable,&#10;  SUM(pm.gross_payable)    AS gross_payable,&#10;  SUM(pm.gross_receivable - pm.gross_payable) AS net_position,&#10;  COUNT(*)                 AS txn_count&#10;FROM trade_settlement_item pm&#10;WHERE pm.settle_month = DATE &#39;2026-08-01&#39;&#10;  AND pm.business_nature = &#39;current_account&#39;&#10;  AND pm.registration_required = FALSE&#10;GROUP BY pm.entity_code, pm.currency&#10;HAVING SUM(pm.gross_receivable - pm.gross_payable) &lt;&gt; 0&#10;ORDER BY ABS(SUM(pm.gross_receivable - pm.gross_payable)) DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  pm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  pm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gross_receivable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gross_receivable,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gross_payable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gross_payable,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gross_receivable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gross_payable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_position,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> txn_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trade_settlement_item pm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">settle_month</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-08-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">business_nature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'current_account'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">registration_required</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gross_receivable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gross_payable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gross_receivable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gross_payable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询给出的是一个结算月内每个成员的净头寸，正是轧差净额结算的输入。注意 <code>registration_required = FALSE</code> 这个过滤条件——它把不得参加集中收付的登记表业务排除掉，是合规逻辑在数据层的落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过渡-变更与注销\">过渡、变更与注销</h2><p>资金池不是一次备案永久有效。合作银行、主办企业、业务种类、外债或境外放款额度发生变更，应在变更之日起 <strong>30 日内</strong>申请变更备案；成员变更但不涉及额度的，应在 30 日内报告合作银行，由银行在&quot;数字外管&quot;银行版和 RCPMIS 中办理。主办企业应在备案通知书出具后<strong>一年内</strong>开立国内资金主账户并实际开展业务，逾期通知书失效。终止业务时需先结清债权债务、关闭主账户，再申请注销并交回通知书原件。一体化资金池规则还对已开展其他资金池并取得新备案的集团设置了<strong>一年过渡期</strong>，用于完成存量资金与账户的清理。</p>\n<p>这些时限在<a href=\"../intercompany-funding-transfer/bank-account-signatory-structure\">银行账户体系与签约行/签字权管理</a>里对应到具体的账户开立与授权流程；而额度占用产生的内部债权债务如何定价与合规，见<a href=\"../intercompany-funding-transfer/intercompany-loan-capitalization\">多实体内部借贷与资本弱化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跨境归集的核心矛盾是经常项目与资本项目的分类管理，资金池是横跨两类的专门载体。</li>\n<li>境内有两条并行通道：本外币一体化资金池（门槛 70/100/20 亿元）与本外币跨境资金集中运营（一般地区 7 亿元、自贸区 3.5 亿元），原则上不得兼办其他跨境资金池。</li>\n<li>额度由所有者权益基数乘以杠杆率与宏观审慎参数算出，外债与境外放款两套参数不同（外债 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.75</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 1.75</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.75</span></span></span></span></span>，境外放款 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\times 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\times 0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>轧差净额结算有硬的频率下限：每个自然月不少于一次；凭登记表办理的业务不得参加。</li>\n<li>申报上必须做还原申报——池子可以合并操作，但不能合并经营实质。</li>\n<li>备案有效期有硬约束：一年内开户否则失效，变更 30 日内备案，单证留存五年。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨境归集的外汇/资本项目监管约束","id":"跨境归集的外汇-资本项目监管约束"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"现行备案通道：两套并行的规则","id":"现行备案通道-两套并行的规则"},{"level":2,"text":"两类额度的计算与占用","id":"两类额度的计算与占用"},{"level":3,"text":"外债额度集中的计算公式","id":"外债额度集中的计算公式"},{"level":3,"text":"境外放款额度的参数差异","id":"境外放款额度的参数差异"},{"level":3,"text":"集中比例与未集中部分的处理","id":"集中比例与未集中部分的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"账户结构、轧差净额与申报还原","id":"账户结构-轧差净额与申报还原"},{"level":3,"text":"国内资金主账户与 NRA 账户","id":"国内资金主账户与-nra-账户"},{"level":3,"text":"轧差净额结算的监管形式","id":"轧差净额结算的监管形式"},{"level":3,"text":"申报与还原","id":"申报与还原"},{"level":2,"text":"过渡、变更与注销","id":"过渡-变更与注销"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实体归集 vs 名义资金池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/cash-pool-structure/physical-vs-notional-pooling"},"next":{"title":"内部银行与收付款工厂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/cash-pool-structure/inhouse-bank-payment-factory"}}